          <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats RandL2015!!! - on setting your Wedding Date for Thanksgiving - wow! gives a whole new meaning to the day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> plus so easy for people to remember....all kinds of benefits - well done!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also welcome to our forum community - as you say - it has a great feeling, as well as being an excellent resource for everyone to share ideas, insights + experiences - Enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1086\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215286\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215286\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1508\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215287\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215287\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1895\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215288\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215288\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_2303\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215289\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215289\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_2702\"> Photography Is Forever Studios\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215290\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.c